   "source": [
    "# Tutorial 2: Pattern Matching Basics\n",
    "\n",
    "In this tutorial, you'll learn about the three types of pattern matchers in autosubmit-scan:\n",
    "\n",
    "1. **Literal Patterns** - Exact string matching\n",
    "2. **Regex Patterns** - Regular expression matching with flags\n",
    "3. **Callable Patterns** - Custom Python functions for complex matching\n",
    "\n",
    "## Prerequisites\n",
    "\n",
    "- Completed [Tutorial 1: Your First Scan](01_getting_started.ipynb)\n",
    "- Basic understanding of regular expressions (for regex patterns)\n",
    "- Python programming knowledge (for callable patterns)\n",
    "\n",
    "## Setup"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import tempfile\n",
    "from pathlib import Path\n",
    "import yaml\n",
    "from datetime import datetime\n",
    "\n",
    "# Create tutorial workspace\n",
    "tutorial_dir = Path(tempfile.mkdtemp(prefix=\"pattern_tutorial_\"))\n",
    "logs_dir = tutorial_dir / \"logs\"\n",
    "logs_dir.mkdir()\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f\"Tutorial directory: {tutorial_dir}\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Sample Data: Complex Log Files\n",
    "\n",
